WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.240
The US Justice Department hosts the
Google search case’s December 2025 final
judgment on its website.

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:14.200
On the first page, the heading identifies
the District Court for the District of
Columbia.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:19.760
Use the court heading to identify the
decision-maker and the docket number to
find the proceeding.
